| 2 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` moved |
| 3 | - | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 30 |
| 4 | - | compiles, runs | new | `d` = 8 |
| 5 | reads `a` (1), takes `b` (2), overwrites `c` (3), updates `d` (4) | compiles, runs | new | `e` = 11, `f` = 2 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 5
----------

let e = a + 100
let f = b
set c = 30
set d = d * 2

----------
expect unit 5 is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | untouched | unit 5 only reads `a` | `a` = 1 |
| 2 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 5 took `b` when it last ran, and the edit retracts that | `b` moved |
| 3 | - | untouched | unit 5 overwrites `c` without reading it | `c` = 30 |
| 4 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 5 updated `d` when it last ran, and the edit retracts that | `d` = 8 |
| 5 | reads `a` (1), takes `b` (2), overwrites `c` (3), updates `d` (4) | recompiles, runs | edited | `e` = 101, `f` = 2 |

